<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41506" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-torrĭdus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>parched up</i>, <i>burned up</i>, <i>dried up</i> (mostly post-Aug.; not in Cic.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rami platani,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 12, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">86, 18</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manus Mucii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 66, 51</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">retorrida et muscosa prata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 9, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plantae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 12, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 2, 87</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fructus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 22, 35, § 176</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">myrtus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					15, 29, 36, § 121</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(herba) spinis retorrida,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					27, 12, 97, § 122</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mus,</span>”
				<i>dried up</i>, <i>wizen</i>, <i>wrinkled</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Phaedr. 4, 2, 27</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">detriti et retorridi ad litterarum disciplinas
					serius adeunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 15, 30, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vultu gravissimus et retorridus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>gloomy</i>, <i>morose</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Capitol. Max. 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gallicanae mentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lampr. Alex. Sev. 58</span></i>
			.—* <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕtorrĭdē</span></b>  (acc. to I.),
				<i>dryly</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 17, 5,
				3, § 33</span></i>.</div>
